        "raw": "<p>Hi,</p><p>i discussed with Paul and Christopher that i would be willing to help out reduce the shipping costs to europe.</p><p>How?</p><p>I will pick up your games at the Essen Fair 2013 and ship them on saturday to you.</p><p>All you have to do is tell GtG in the survey that you want me ( Tom Hoefle Essen pick up ) to pick it up .</p><p>Normally this would cost you the 40 Dollars - I assume that the games weigh again less than 2 KG (edited) and are smaller than 90 cm ( all three lengths added together ) so i would cost 8,90 &euro; to the EU plus packaging ( i hope GtG can provide that with your adresses )</p><p>So you would me via paypal 10 &euro; ( for the paypal fee ) and you would save a lot of money .</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>edit: </strong></p><p><strong>weight for 8,90 &euro; is 2 KG not 1KG</strong></p><p><strong>if its over 2KG its will cost 15 &euro; </strong></p><p><strong>GtG agreed to package the items - thanx GtG</strong></p><p><strong>Enhanced Edition is&nbsp; about&nbsp; 2 KG</strong></p><p><strong>Vengeance 1,5 KG</strong></p><p><strong>Rook City, Infernal relics, Shattered Timeline each under 1 KG</strong></p><p><strong>i dont know the weight for additional stuff yet but should be no problem</strong></p><p><strong>only the playmat could be a problem :)</strong></p><p><strong>but i assume we can work this out</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If that option is a thing for you contact me at thoefle@aol.com or here and save some money.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tom</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>P.S. i will also post this on BGG</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
